                StoryPart(3, "The Plaque in Storage", listOf(
                    "The maintenance team had removed the plaque with the bench and stored it safely. The parks officer arranged for the class to view it at the depot with adult supervision. The plaque named the Riverside Residents' Association and gave the year of donation. It did not name an individual donor.",
                    "Lela found a newsletter from that year describing a park improvement day. The association had raised funds for several benches, a path repair, and new rubbish bins. The class decided to tell the story as a group effort instead of trying to identify one person as the donor."
